# Tasks

Hi — you need to  build a Sales Insights Dashboard project. Your task: find or create a retail sales dataset, clean and preprocess it, do exploratory data analysis to extract sales trends and KPIs, then build an interactive dashboard (Excel / Power BI / Tableau / Streamlit) that supports filtering by region, category, and month. Deliverables: cleaned dataset (CSV), analysis notebook (Jupyter/Colab), dashboard files or link, and a short findings report (PDF or Markdown). Post your work to the repo under /data-analytics

use tool like power bi, excel,python,tabalue, etc...


folder structure  must like this only in your branch.

/data-analytics
  /data
    raw_sales.csv
    clean_sales.csv
    schema.md
  /notebooks
    01_cleaning.ipynb
    02_eda.ipynb
  /analysis
    kpis.md
  /dashboard
    app.py  (or .pbix / .twbx)
    requirements.txt
  /report
    insights.md
    slides.pdf
  README.md

step by step process:

Put raw dataset as data/raw_sales.csv and data/schema.md.

Clean data & save data/clean_sales.csv and notebooks/01_cleaning.ipynb.

Do EDA in notebooks/02_eda.ipynb (include short interpretation text for every chart).

Create dashboard under /dashboard (Power BI file or Streamlit app.py) with filters for Region, Category, Month.

Add analysis/kpis.md and report/insights.md (6 bullet insights + 3 recommendations).

Create presentation/slides.pdf with 6 slides (Problem → Data → Key Metrics → Visuals → Insights → Next steps).
Push to GitHub and tell me the link. If you prefer, upload a zip. Ping me whenever you finish a milestone and I’ll review.




